   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=104602 day=10 vid=gen_6r9954q kind=guard-passes pick="[goon] \"Keep going.\"" triggerPick="[ans:q_alone_time:a_tell] \"Every day. I go for walks that don't need to happen. Just to breathe my own air.\"" prevThem="\"I get it. Solitude's a resource too. Scarcer than food, some days.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=104602 day=29 vid=gen_bdythac kind=guard-nod pick="[goon] \"And?\"" triggerPick="[ans:q_believe:a_tell] \"I believe we get through this. I have to. The alternative doesn't work.\"" prevThem="\"That's not naive. That's load-bearing. Hold onto it.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=104602 day=34 vid=gen_bdythac kind=guard-nothing pick="[goon] \"Keep going.\"" triggerPick="[teach] \"Here, I know this one — let me show you.\"" prevThem="You show them American Hazelnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=104602 day=44 vid=gen_c78mria kind=guard-nod pick="[goon] \"And?\"" triggerPick="[ans:q_night:a_yes] \"I heard them too.\"" prevThem="They go still. \"So it's not just me. Good. That's... good to know. Bad, but good.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=104602 day=85 vid=gen_bdythac kind=guard-hear pick="[goon] \"Yeah?\"" triggerPick="[teach] \"Here, I know this one — let me show you.\"" prevThem="You show them Bissap Hibiscus — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
   Q2-GUARDLINES seed=104602 day=88 vid=zoe_adams kind=guard-sit pick="[goon] \"Yeah?\"" triggerPick="[ans:q_first_week:a_shock] \"Honestly? Shock. Just kept moving.\"" prevThem="\"Shock's underrated. It's the body's way of buying you time.\""
